From e436c730dfc804e1c512bf672772e4f6241c3cbf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nmustakin <nmust004@ucr.edu>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 13:26:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add MINI2/MINI3/SMALL2/SMALL3 datasets and per-SIZE binaries

- Every kernel header gains MINI2, MINI3, SMALL2 and SMALL3 dataset sizes
  between the stock MINI, SMALL and MEDIUM sizes.
- makefile-gen.pl: generated Makefiles take SIZE (default MEDIUM) and build
  <kernel>-<SIZE> with -D<SIZE>_DATASET; link deriche with -lm.
- run-all.pl: run the <kernel>-<SIZE> binaries.
